[MessageEvent]
MessageEvent (agent)
  assistant: I have identified that the ConversationManager.apply_management was only called once after the entire agent loop completed, which caused the message list to grow excessively during the loop.

I modified the agent.py file to call conversation_manager.apply_management(self) after yielding each event in the asynchronous loop inside _execute_event_loop_cycle. This should progressively prune old messages during the agent loop execution and keep message count manageable, improving performance espec...
